# Everything the image must not carry. `out/`, `state/` and `data/` are also in
# .gitignore - data/ as "large, proprietary" - and repeating them here is the point:
# a build from a working checkout would otherwise pick up 80MB of course exports,
# findings and SQLite state and bake them into a pushable image.
out/
state/
data/
.git/
.github/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.local
tests/
docs/
*.md
!DEPLOY.md
